    <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs the file name to be used when utilizing a multi-tile mosaic. This is currenly used in the diag_manager and data_override in so that any output files will include the tile number of the writer. Uses the format &quot;filename.tileN.nc&quot; and requires the filename to already include the .nc suffix. </para>    </briefdescription>
